[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186115241 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" "question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/id #uuid "35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-131713" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 4x-8y &=4 \\\\ -4x+8y &=-4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the standard Gauss-Jordan method, we can reduce this matrix to reduced row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now  \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$ and we have one free variable, $y.$ That means we need to find $x$  in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2y+1 \\\\ y &=y,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y+1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/id #uuid "5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" "answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" "answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" "answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" "answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" :answer/id #uuid "06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" :answer/id #uuid "d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer/id #uuid "d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2y+1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" :answer/id #uuid "542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4" :answer/id #uuid "6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/id #uuid "0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/math-academy-id "q-131714" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+z &=4 \\\\ y-3z &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the standard Gauss-Jordan method, we can reduce this matrix to reduced row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now  \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-5z &=2 \\\\ y-3z &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=5z+2 \\\\ y &=3z-1 \\\\ z &=z,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/id #uuid "38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" "answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" "answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" "answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" "answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" :answer/id #uuid "b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2z+5 \\\\ z-3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" :answer/id #uuid "98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z+1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer/id #uuid "955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" :answer/id #uuid "7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z-2 \\\\ 1-3z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33" :answer/id #uuid "75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/id #uuid "2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/math-academy-id "q-74636" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+y &=-1 \\\\ 2x+3y &=3 \\\\ -x-4y &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is inconsistent\n\nII. The system has a unique solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-1,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement I is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/id #uuid "eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" "answer-33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" "answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" "answer-4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" "answer-4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/id #uuid "2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/id #uuid "33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/id #uuid "b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/id #uuid "4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/id #uuid "4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}] "assertions" [["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/id #uuid "35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d"] ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-131713"] ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 4x-8y &=4 \\\\ -4x+8y &=-4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the standard Gauss-Jordan method, we can reduce this matrix to reduced row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now  \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$ and we have one free variable, $y.$ That means we need to find $x$  in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2y+1 \\\\ y &=y,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y+1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/id #uuid "5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6"] ["answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" :answer/id #uuid "06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45"] ["answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" :answer/id #uuid "d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb"] ["answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer/id #uuid "d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b"] ["answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2y+1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" :answer/id #uuid "542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353"] ["answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4" :answer/id #uuid "6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4"] ["answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4" :answer/value "No solution"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/correct "answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/choices "answer-06bab61c-40c1-5534-b5a3-b01a2dbdfa45"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/choices "answer-d677f02b-fbae-5fc9-ab27-d903e38bc1fb"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/choices "answer-d860981f-7d25-50fb-9bda-57a830f77a4b"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/choices "answer-542610ce-dff1-581e-80ae-2cef01f7f353"] ["answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6" :answer-field/choices "answer-6d65baaa-b447-55bf-9ca2-d0463511c9a4"] ["question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-5be30950-b64e-577a-ae02-66dc69074ea6"] [17592186115241 :knowledge-point/questions "question-35e39332-390d-57d5-8a71-b2e823ef2c1d"] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/id #uuid "0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86"] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/math-academy-id "q-131714"] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+z &=4 \\\\ y-3z &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the standard Gauss-Jordan method, we can reduce this matrix to reduced row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now  \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-5z &=2 \\\\ y-3z &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=5z+2 \\\\ y &=3z-1 \\\\ z &=z,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/id #uuid "38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b"] ["answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" :answer/id #uuid "b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151"] ["answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2z+5 \\\\ z-3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" :answer/id #uuid "98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f"] ["answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z+1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer/id #uuid "955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7"] ["answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z+2 \\\\ 3z-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" :answer/id #uuid "7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd"] ["answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5z-2 \\\\ 1-3z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33" :answer/id #uuid "75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33"] ["answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33" :answer/value "No solution"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/correct "answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/choices "answer-b6f517b4-7123-5de7-839e-f81b3c72b151"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/choices "answer-98404353-5e33-5e35-891f-c0850dff8c0f"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/choices "answer-955edd2d-0a8c-5d20-84d7-cf5a92e290b7"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/choices "answer-7cff60bc-e993-580b-aba0-33e3b2b248dd"] ["answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b" :answer-field/choices "answer-75022ec7-7eef-58e8-96f6-520f1f5efd33"] ["question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-38a28058-8837-5c47-bd4f-999f7f79529b"] [17592186115241 :knowledge-point/questions "question-0d9a8a04-d6f4-5dae-8ede-86bd3b61ce86"] ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/id #uuid "2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891"] ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/math-academy-id "q-74636"] ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+y &=-1 \\\\ 2x+3y &=3 \\\\ -x-4y &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is inconsistent\n\nII. The system has a unique solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent"] ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-1,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement I is true."] ["question-2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/id #uuid "eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6"] ["answer-2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/id #uuid "2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc"] ["answer-2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/id #uuid "33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521"] ["answer-33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/value "I and III only"] ["answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/id #uuid "b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f"] ["answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/id #uuid "4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863"] ["answer-4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/id #uuid "4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d"] ["answer-4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/value "III only"] ["answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-eda18abf-1e9e-51e